### star-idea-storm/SKILL.md
--- 1
Per kept direction, per `references/scan_policy.md` (Chinese dialogue: `references/scan_policy_zh.md`): build 2–3 queries, run them across the Semantic Scholar / arXiv / DBLP search endpoints plus web search, and collect 8–15 papers (title / venue / year / citations / one-clause relevance / record URL). Write that direction's §3 block as soon as its scan finishes: the scan table, a note on how crowded the area is (publication rate and trajectory, venues, named groups if evident, survey existence), the 3 closest works with what each one's abstract does **not** claim, and the apparent gap. Default depth is title + abstract; deepen — intro and related-work first paragraph of that direction's top-3 — only when the user names a direction or a gap claim decides between finalists, and record it in the block's `depth:` line. Scanning may fan out to read-only `subagent` subagents (`subagent_type: Explore`, `model:` the READ tier value the opening load returned, omitted when that key is empty), run in parallel, one direction each, each returning the collector format in `references/scan_policy.md` — the briefing, and each collector's share of the rate budget, are built by the main agent, never by the collector; the main agent writes the file and owns every judgment line. Surprises — crowded where empty was expected, a same-question preprint from the last 6 months — are reported the moment they are found, not at stage end. A failed search is reported as failed, never padded.
+++ 1
Per kept direction, per `references/scan_policy.md` (Chinese dialogue: `references/scan_policy_zh.md`): build 2–3 queries, run them across the Semantic Scholar / arXiv / DBLP search endpoints plus web search, and collect 8–15 papers (title / venue / year / citations / one-clause relevance / record URL). Write that direction's §3 block as soon as its scan finishes: the scan table, a note on how crowded the area is (publication rate and trajectory, venues, named groups if evident, survey existence), the 3 closest works with what each one's abstract does **not** claim, and the apparent gap. Default depth is title + abstract; deepen — intro and related-work first paragraph of that direction's top-3 — only when the user names a direction or a gap claim decides between finalists, and record it in the block's `depth:` line. Scanning may fan out to read-only `subagent` calls, run in parallel, one direction each, each returning the collector format in `references/scan_policy.md` — the briefing, and each collector's share of the rate budget, are built by the main agent, never by the collector; the main agent writes the file and owns every judgment line. Surprises — crowded where empty was expected, a same-question preprint from the last 6 months — are reported the moment they are found, not at stage end. A failed search is reported as failed, never padded.
### star-idea-storm/SKILL_zh.md
--- 1
**把档位模型传给受托者。** 派发前取 `claude` 条目，没有则取不带标签的备选。该档每次派发都把解析值传给 `subagent` 的 `model`；键为空则省略。模型须为当前工具所接受，后文规定的角色与写入限制照旧。盲读只拿产物与量表，不继承产出该工作的对话。模型不可用就留在这里并说明一条原因；派发被拒后，须确认它尚未开始工作才能退回本地。受托者从自己的会话溯源解析实际模型，不从请求中的别名或父会话转录取值。
+++ 1
**把档位模型传给受托者。** 取 `dsh` 条目，没有则取不带标签的备选。当前随项目使用的 `subagent` 工具不提供按次选模参数。底层 provider 支持模型配置，不等于工具能接收它：不臆造 `model` 或 `agentOptions`，不改全局 profile，不另启 CLI 绕过限制。保持原执行与委派路径；档位键已设时说明当前工具无法选择它。以后安装的工具若明确提供选模接口，只使用该接口及支持它的传输方式。键为空则什么都不变。后文的角色、盲读隔离和写入限制照旧；溯源记录实际运行模型，不记录配了但未使用的档位值。
### star-idea-storm/SKILL_zh.md
--- 1
对每个入围方向，按 `references/scan_policy.md`（中文对话读 `references/scan_policy_zh.md`）：起 2–3 个查询词，跑 Semantic Scholar / arXiv / DBLP 搜索端点加网页搜索，收 8–15 篇（标题 / venue / 年份 / 引用数 / 一小句相关性 / 记录 URL）。某方向扫完就立即写它的 §3 块：扫描表、竞争激烈程度说明（发文速率与走势、venue 分布、看得出的团队、有无综述）、3 篇最接近的工作及各自摘要**没有**声称的东西、表面缺口。默认深度为标题 + 摘要；只有用户指明某方向、或某条缺口判断直接决定两个入选方向的去留时才加深——读该方向 top-3 的 intro 与 related work 首段——并记录在该块的 `depth:` 行。扫描可派出只读收集器 `subagent` 子代理（`subagent_type: Explore`、`model:` 取开场装载返回的 READ 档值，该键为空时不带这个参数），并行派发、每个负责一个方向、各自按 `references/scan_policy_zh.md` 的收集器返回格式返回——交办说明、以及按份数分给各收集器的速率配额，都由主 agent 构建，收集器绝不自己攒；主 agent 写文件，并亲自下所有判断行。意外——预期冷清处很拥挤、近 6 个月出现同问题 preprint——一发现就立刻说，不等阶段结束。搜索失败如实报告失败，绝不填充。
+++ 1
